{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all non-zero real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e9751192318784df8ade897d93b36f2ea2db42c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y=xy, \\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"143\" height=\"40\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d77028f4ca1bd53642ff511f809f3834d62292f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{xy}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{x-y}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }0\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }-1\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }y-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"460\" height=\"40\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Moving all variables to one side of the equation, we can use Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick to factor the equation into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/c/1ac3e870b41f0001119009c86cbdaec0d369a6e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+1)(y-1) = -1\\]\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" /> Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> sides respectively, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Plugging this in to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/c/9fc5562ca3f9e369e98a1d3b0fb7abf82f48005a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"48\" height=\"40\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae5d7cd93e4ba1e195cd55e90697bda6c177d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"35\" height=\"24\" /> as our final answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that we can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a32e351572aa948e403233ca90ead75bba24a504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-y}{xy} = \\frac{xy}{xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"96\" height=\"41\" />. We are left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/2463868d8cca0915005d1617957e2d0fcb249c7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{y} - \\frac{1}{x} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" />. Multiply by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> to achieve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/4/ec4316c4bc991509655647861da2c2f0accd4011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{1}{y} = \\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"109\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016214342\nCache expiry